omaly Survival Horror</strong> <br>Search every room, uncover clues, and keep your wits sharp\u2014or fear will consume you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f <strong>Exploration</strong> <br>Unlock new areas and push the story forward with rising tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f <strong>Butterfly Effect</strong> <br>Your actions shape the outcome. Every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f <strong>Multiple Endings</strong> <br>Three possible fates await. Miss a detail, and the truth may slip away forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879090?t=1762009135","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879090/5d3d8a21675a64db9b584656e5300ab78a8358c1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762009135","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879090/6d219d80f7508028368e5f42ca3f7c6460246dc1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762009135","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879090/6d219d80f7508028368e5f42ca3f7c6460246dc1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762009135","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Some sequences may cause you some discomfort or feelings of violence"},"demos":[{"appid":4043910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879090/extras/214699d1adfdd4a2a797140697144a37.avif?t=1762009135\" width=639 height=160 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class